# SDK-First Rule

- Always search existing `github.com/liukunxin/go-infra` capabilities before adding new infra code.
- Reuse SDK modules for logging, tracing, errors, metrics, http/grpc/ws client wrappers, mysql/redis/kafka where applicable.
- Keep wrappers thin; put integrations in `apps/*/bootstrap` or `pkg|packages/*`.
- Do not create parallel logging/tracing/error stacks.

## Baseline requirements

- Logs: use `pkg/base/log`.
- Tracing: use `pkg/base/trace`.
- Errors: use `pkg/base/errors`.

If a capability is missing in SDK, add the minimal adapter and document why.

